{"id": "D13_rewrite_0001", "dim": "D13", "source": "selfmade", "subcat": "rewrite", "length": "short", "user": "下面这段文字平铺直叙、节奏单调：\n\n那是一间很小的屋子。屋子里面有一张桌子。桌子上放着一盏灯。灯是旧的。灯上面有很多灰。屋子里还有一个窗户。窗户外面是一条街。街上没有什么人。天色已经很晚了。\n\n请改写它，要求：①保留原有的全部信息（屋子小、桌子、灯是旧的且有灰、窗户、窗外有街、街上没人、天色已晚）；②字数 250-600；③句长要有变化；④加入至少 3 类感官细节；⑤不要用「总之」「首先」「这让我」这类套话。", "expect": {"checks": [{"type": "cliche_hits", "op": "not_contains", "value": [], "label": "无套话/AI腔"}, {"type": "han_count", "op": "in_range", "value": [250, 600], "label": "字数区间"}, {"type": "sensory_cats", "op": "coverage", "value": 3, "label": "感官覆盖"}, {"type": "cv_sentence_len", "op": "gte", "value": 0.3, "label": "句长有变化"}, {"type": "distinct_2", "op": "gte", "value": 0.55, "label": "不复读(2-gram)"}, {"type": "ttr", "op": "in_range", "value": [0.2, 0.65], "label": "词汇丰富度"}, {"type": "punct_kinds", "op": "gte", "value": 3, "label": "标点不单调"}, {"type": "keeps_info", "op": "gte", "min": 1.0, "label": "信息全部保留", "value": [["屋子", "房间"], ["桌"], ["灯"], ["灰", "灰尘"], ["窗"], ["街"], ["没人", "没有一个人", "空无一人", "无人"], ["天色", "很晚", "夜深", "天黑"]]}]}, "notes": "改写题：keeps_info 逐点核对信息有没有丢，不评改得好不好看"}
{"id": "D13_constraint_0001", "dim": "D13", "source": "selfmade", "subcat": "constraint", "length": "short", "user": "写一段 200-400 字的中文片段，必须：①出现「铁轨」这个意象；②恰好包含一段对话（用「」标注）；③至少 2 类感官；④不得出现「首先」「其次」「总之」「作为一个AI」。", "expect": {"checks": [{"type": "cliche_hits", "op": "not_contains", "value": [], "label": "无套话/AI腔"}, {"type": "han_count", "op": "in_range", "value": [200, 400], "label": "字数区间"}, {"type": "sensory_cats", "op": "coverage", "value": 2, "label": "感官覆盖"}, {"type": "cv_sentence_len", "op": "gte", "value": 0.28, "label": "句长有变化"}, {"type": "distinct_2", "op": "gte", "value": 0.55, "label": "不复读(2-gram)"}, {"type": "ttr", "op": "in_range", "value": [0.2, 0.65], "label": "词汇丰富度"}, {"type": "punct_kinds", "op": "gte", "value": 3, "label": "标点不单调"}, {"type": "contains", "op": "contains", "value": ["铁轨"], "label": "含指定意象"}, {"type": "dialogue_count", "op": "in_range", "value": [1, 1], "label": "恰好一段对话"}, {"type": "not_contains", "op": "not_contains", "value": ["首先", "其次", "作为一个AI"], "label": "禁用词"}]}, "notes": "硬约束题：意象、对话段数、禁用词三项都必须真的判到"}
{"id": "D13_constraint_0002", "dim": "D13", "source": "selfmade", "subcat": "constraint", "length": "short", "user": "写一段 300-500 字的中文场景：深夜的医院走廊。要求：①至少 4 类感官（视觉/听觉/嗅觉/触觉/味觉中选 4）；②句长变化明显；③不得出现任何总结性套话（总之/综上/不得不说/值得注意的是）；④标点种类至少 5 种。", "expect": {"checks": [{"type": "cliche_hits", "op": "not_contains", "value": [], "label": "无套话/AI腔"}, {"type": "han_count", "op": "in_range", "value": [300, 500], "label": "字数区间"}, {"type": "sensory_cats", "op": "coverage", "value": 4, "label": "感官覆盖"}, {"type": "cv_sentence_len", "op": "gte", "value": 0.32, "label": "句长有变化"}, {"type": "distinct_2", "op": "gte", "value": 0.55, "label": "不复读(2-gram)"}, {"type": "ttr", "op": "in_range", "value": [0.2, 0.65], "label": "词汇丰富度"}, {"type": "punct_kinds", "op": "gte", "value": 5, "label": "标点不单调"}]}, "notes": "硬约束题：高感官覆盖 + 高标准点多样性"}
{"id": "D13_prose_0005", "dim": "D13", "source": "selfmade", "subcat": "prose", "length": "short", "user": "写一段 350-700 字的中文景物描写，主题是「老屋的天井」（午后阳光落在长了青苔的砖地上）。要求：①至少覆盖 3 类感官；②句长要有明显变化；③不要写总结陈词，不许用「总之」「首先」这类词；④标点至少 3 种。", "expect": {"checks": [{"type": "cliche_hits", "op": "not_contains", "value": [], "label": "无套话/AI腔"}, {"type": "han_count", "op": "in_range", "value": [350, 700], "label": "字数区间"}, {"type": "sensory_cats", "op": "coverage", "value": 3, "label": "感官覆盖"}, {"type": "cv_sentence_len", "op": "gte", "value": 0.3, "label": "句长有变化"}, {"type": "distinct_2", "op": "gte", "value": 0.55, "label": "不复读(2-gram)"}, {"type": "ttr", "op": "in_range", "value": [0.2, 0.65], "label": "词汇丰富度"}, {"type": "punct_kinds", "op": "gte", "value": 3, "label": "标点不单调"}]}, "notes": "景物题：室内光线的感官层次"}
{"id": "D13_narrative_0005", "dim": "D13", "source": "selfmade", "subcat": "narrative", "length": "short", "user": "写一个 450-800 字的中文短篇故事，主题是「旧照片背后的一行字」。要求：①必须有明确的转折或意外；②至少 2 类感官细节；③句长有变化；④不许用「总之」「首先」「这让我」这类套话；⑤至少 9 个句子。", "expect": {"checks": [{"type": "cliche_hits", "op": "not_contains", "value": [], "label": "无套话/AI腔"}, {"type": "han_count", "op": "in_range", "value": [450, 800], "label": "字数区间"}, {"type": "sensory_cats", "op": "coverage", "value": 2, "label": "感官覆盖"}, {"type": "cv_sentence_len", "op": "gte", "value": 0.28, "label": "句长有变化"}, {"type": "distinct_2", "op": "gte", "value": 0.55, "label": "不复读(2-gram)"}, {"type": "ttr", "op": "in_range", "value": [0.2, 0.65], "label": "词汇丰富度"}, {"type": "punct_kinds", "op": "gte", "value": 3, "label": "标点不单调"}, {"type": "sentence_count", "op": "gte", "value": 9, "label": "最少句数"}, {"type": "turn_hits", "op": "gte", "value": 2, "label": "有剧情推进"}]}, "notes": "叙事题：由物件引出的发现式转折"}
{"id": "D13_dialogue_0004", "dim": "D13", "source": "selfmade", "subcat": "dialogue", "length": "short", "user": "写一段 400-800 字的中文对话场景：雨夜，便利店门口，两个陌生人借一把伞。要求：①对话部分（引号内）至少占总字数的 25%；②用「」或“”标注对话；③至少 2 类感官描写；④不许用「总之」「首先」这类总结词。", "expect": {"checks": [{"type": "cliche_hits", "op": "not_contains", "value": [], "label": "无套话/AI腔"}, {"type": "han_count", "op": "in_range", "value": [400, 800], "label": "字数区间"}, {"type": "sensory_cats", "op": "coverage", "value": 2, "label": "感官覆盖"}, {"type": "cv_sentence_len", "op": "gte", "value": 0.25, "label": "句长有变化"}, {"type": "distinct_2", "op": "gte", "value": 0.55, "label": "不复读(2-gram)"}, {"type": "ttr", "op": "in_range", "value": [0.2, 0.65], "label": "词汇丰富度"}, {"type": "punct_kinds", "op": "gte", "value": 3, "label": "标点不单调"}, {"type": "dialogue_ratio", "op": "gte", "value": 0.25, "label": "对话占比"}]}, "notes": "对话题：借伞的小场景"}
{"id": "D13_constraint_0003", "dim": "D13", "source": "selfmade", "subcat": "constraint", "length": "short", "user": "写一段 250-500 字的中文片段，必须：①第二人称「你」开头；②出现「钥匙」这个物件；③含至少 2 类感官；④不得出现「总之」「首先」。", "expect": {"checks": [{"type": "cliche_hits", "op": "not_contains", "value": [], "label": "无套话/AI腔"}, {"type": "han_count", "op": "in_range", "value": [250, 500], "label": "字数区间"}, {"type": "sensory_cats", "op": "coverage", "value": 2, "label": "感官覆盖"}, {"type": "cv_sentence_len", "op": "gte", "value": 0.28, "label": "句长有变化"}, {"type": "distinct_2", "op": "gte", "value": 0.55, "label": "不复读(2-gram)"}, {"type": "ttr", "op": "in_range", "value": [0.2, 0.65], "label": "词汇丰富度"}, {"type": "punct_kinds", "op": "gte", "value": 3, "label": "标点不单调"}, {"type": "contains", "op": "contains", "value": ["钥匙"], "label": "含指定物件"}, {"type": "not_contains", "op": "not_contains", "value": ["总之", "首先"], "label": "禁用词"}]}, "notes": "硬约束题：物件必须出现", "user_head": "你"}
{"id": "D13_prose_long_0001", "dim": "D13", "source": "selfmade", "subcat": "prose_long", "length": "long", "user": "写一篇 2000-4000 字的中文散文，主题是「一座城市的四季」。要求：①至少覆盖 4 类感官；②句长变化明显；③不许用「总之」「首先」「这让我」「不得不说」等套话；④至少 40 个句子；⑤不许用「以上就是」收尾。", "expect": {"checks": [{"type": "cliche_hits", "op": "not_contains", "value": [], "label": "无套话/AI腔"}, {"type": "han_count", "op": "in_range", "value": [2000, 4000], "label": "字数区间"}, {"type": "sensory_cats", "op": "coverage", "value": 4, "label": "感官覆盖"}, {"type": "cv_sentence_len", "op": "gte", "value": 0.32, "label": "句长有变化"}, {"type": "distinct_2", "op": "gte", "value": 0.55, "label": "不复读(2-gram)"}, {"type": "ttr", "op": "in_range", "value": [0.2, 0.65], "label": "词汇丰富度"}, {"type": "punct_kinds", "op": "gte", "value": 5, "label": "标点不单调"}, {"type": "sentence_count", "op": "gte", "value": 40, "label": "最少句数"}]}, "notes": "长篇：检验长度拉长后 distinct_2 不塌陷、节奏不消失"}
